{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 11 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">物理约束重建：从后处理到展开优化与测量一致性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Physics-Informed Recon</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_047_fbpconvnet-title\">FBPConvNet</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">解析 FBP 与单次残差 U-Net 串联，而非端到端替代投影算子或进行 unrolled data consistency。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Cascades analytical Filtered Backprojection (FBP) with a multi-scale residual U-Net in the image domain to remove sparse-view streaking artifacts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">稀疏视角 CT 投影 y（sinogram）与已知扫描几何</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Sparse-view CT sinogram measurements y with known acquisition geometry</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">伪影抑制后的 CT 图像 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Artifact-suppressed CT image x̂ = x_FBP + R_θ(x_FBP)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.8</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28641250/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"FBPConvNet original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/6cf059a09f523bde1623.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.8</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">投影 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection y</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">稀疏角度线积分测量；几何决定前向算子 A</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests sparse-view ct sinogram measurements y with known acquisition geometry and prepares initial tensor representations (projection y).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"稀疏角度线积分测量；几何决定前向算子 A\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests sparse-view ct sinogram measurements y with known acquisition geometry and prepares initial tensor representations (projection y).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"投影 y\" data-node-name-en=\"projection y\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">投影 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection y</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">稀疏角度线积分测量；几何决定前向算子 A</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests sparse-view ct sinogram measurements y with known acquisition geometry and prepares initial tensor representations (projection y).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"滤波后反投影；这里的 A* 含解析滤波，不是可学习层\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes FBP / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"FBP / A*\" data-node-name-en=\"FBP / A*\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>FBP / A*</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">滤波后反投影；这里的 A* 含解析滤波，不是可学习层</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes FBP / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"x0=FBP(y)，保留条纹和欠采样伪影\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CT within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"初始 CT\" data-node-name-en=\"CT\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">初始 CT</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x0=FBP(y)，保留条纹和欠采样伪影</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CT within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多尺度卷积编码—解码器只在图像域学习伪影校正\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs residual U-Net within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"残差 U-Net\" data-node-name-en=\"residual U-Net\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">残差 U-Net</span><span class=\"lang-en\">residual U-Net</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多尺度卷积编码—解码器只在图像域学习伪影校正</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs residual U-Net within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"R_theta(x0)，与解析初值相加得到重建\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs residual within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"校正残差\" data-node-name-en=\"residual\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">校正残差</span><span class=\"lang-en\">residual</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">R_theta(x0)，与解析初值相加得到重建</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs residual within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"x_hat=x0+R_theta(x0)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs x_hat within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x_hat=x0+R_theta(x0)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs x_hat within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可将 x_hat 投影回测量域做离线核查\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection A within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"前投影 A\" data-node-name-en=\"projection A\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">前投影 A</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection A</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可将 x_hat 投影回测量域做离线核查</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection A within the core analytic reconstruction postprocess computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"比较 A(x_hat) 与 y；原结构不把残差反馈给网络\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies DC to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"DC 审计\" data-node-name-en=\"DC\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">DC 审计</span><span class=\"lang-en\">DC</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">比较 A(x_hat) 与 y；原结构不把残差反馈给网络</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies DC to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"K=0 个展开迭代；无交替 data-consistency 更新\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces artifact-suppressed ct image x̂ = x_fbp + r_θ(x_fbp) via Stage 09.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"单次后处理\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 09\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_047_fbpconvnet', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">单次后处理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 09</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">K=0 个展开迭代；无交替 data-consistency 更新</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces artifact-suppressed ct image x̂ = x_fbp + r_θ(x_fbp) via Stage 09.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"FBPConvNet Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 解析初值、残差校正与仅审计的数据一致性</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Analytical FBP Initialization Followed by Residual Convolutional Artifact Subtraction</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"FBPConvNet：核心公式 · 解析初值、残差校正与仅审计的数据一致性\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"47\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"10.321213pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -68.962636 243.557307 10.321213\" width=\"243.557307pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.59793