use x=\"40.4413\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g7-185\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"44.15736\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g13-71\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"48.879651\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g17-48\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"53.014141\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g7-186\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"56.829817\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g13-150\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"70.893691\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g13-65\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"75.167662\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g17-68\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"80.418575\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g17-67\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"88.534939\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g1-61\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"98.385704\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g13-22\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"105.805357\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g20-94\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"104.60238\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g13-71\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"111.722818\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g7-0\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"120.671425\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g13-72\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"128.240748\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-40\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"131.558309\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-97\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"135.981724\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-117\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"140.963044\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-100\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"145.944364\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-105\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"148.713977\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-116\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"153.974249\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-111\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"158.95557\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-110\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"163.93689\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-108\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"166.457436\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-121\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"171.438756\" xlink:href=\"#m047_g21-41\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">解析稀疏 CT 重建存在条纹，而直接端到端学习难扩展</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Analytical FBP suffers from severe streaking under sparse views, while traditional iterative MBIR takes minutes to hours per volume.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">先做解析 FBP，再用 residual U-Net/CNN 去除稀疏视角伪影</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Exploit the fact that normal-operator streaking artifacts in 2D CT have a translational convolutional structure well matched to a multi-scale residual U-Net.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">保留快速成熟的 FBP，并只学习 image-domain artifact residual</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Fast analytical FBP inversion + residual U-Net learning the difference between streaked FBP and full-view ground truth.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为 sparse-view CT 极强 post-processing 基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Canonical, fast image-domain post-processing baseline for sparse-view and low-dose CT reconstruction.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">历史与实用价值高；推理后无 projection data consistency</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">High practical speed and historical impact, but enforces zero projection-domain data consistency at inference—risking hallucinated or smoothed subtle lesions.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">先用已知 CT 物理得到可解释的 FBP 初值，再把学习限制为图像域残差校正。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">U-Net 的多尺度感受野能识别由稀疏角度造成的全局条纹，同时长跳连保留局部结构。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">该模型没有展开迭代和反馈式数据一致性；视觉改善不保证 A(x_hat) 与实测投影一致。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Exploit the fact that normal-operator streaking artifacts in 2D CT have a translational convolutional structure well matched to a multi-scale residual U-Net.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Fast analytical FBP inversion + residual U-Net learning the difference between streaked FBP and full-view ground truth.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Analytical FBP Initialization Followed by Residual Convolutional Artifact Subtraction.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合作为稀疏视角或低剂量 CT 的快速后处理基线，部署链路短。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">对训练分布外的金属、截断或新几何，残差网络可能删去病灶或补出结构，必须回投影审计。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Canonical, fast image-domain post-processing baseline for sparse-view and low-dose CT reconstruction.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: High practical speed and historical impact, but enforces zero projection-domain data consistency at inference—risking hallucinated or smoothed subtle lesions.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28641250/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Deep Convolutional Neural Network for Inverse Problems in Imaging</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<span class=\"spec-muted-val\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">未提供官方实现</span><span class=\"lang-en\">No Official Repository</span></span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}